  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support 550 Displaced Girl Children Back to School</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Initiative aims at raising support and awareness of the plight of the internally displaced girls in our community. This is to help 550 Girl children back to school by providing breakfast and lunch, non-tuition fees, books, pens, uniforms, shoes, and sanitary pads. 550 out-of-school girls in our community need to be back in school. Your support will help give them a leg up in life and strengthen our community&apos;s future. Also, it will help prevent forced marriage and absenteeism from school.</narrative>
  </description>
